# Agent skills: .claude/skills/<name> is a symlink to .agents/skills/<name>
# (the tracked, canonical copy). On machines where git can't store real
# symlinks (core.symlinks=false, common on Windows), `git add` would
# otherwise silently follow it and duplicate every file underneath.
/.claude/skills/
